      "statusChangeNewStatus": "available in future release",
      "value": "Thank you for your request!\n\nAvatars can be hidden based on their download size.\n\nIn a future update, the performance rank will also depend on its texture memory usage. This will help you avoid avatars with unoptimized textures.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
